[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 25810.07, "timestamp": "07:10:10", "text": "。我沒看見，我沒看見"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25823.59, "timestamp": "07:10:23", "text": "我這就去吃點東西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25827.19, "timestamp": "07:10:27", "text": "，一會兒就"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25830.03, "timestamp": "07:10:30", "text": "回來。你好。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25839.83, "timestamp": "07:10:39", "text": "嗯，我們會維持現狀。我馬上更新縮圖和其他所有內容。我最終還是得做這件事。所以，我會更新縮圖安裝。請稍等片刻。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25848.19, "timestamp": "07:10:48", "text": "[音樂]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25852.15, "timestamp": "07:10:52", "text": "嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25853.43, "timestamp": "07:10:53", "text": "我想我找到你的縮圖了。我不知道"}]